      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I’m so absorbed in reading about Sedona, Arizona—they’re really into crystals there, apparently; who knew?—that I manage",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1580
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shit!” I shout, so startled that I almost drop the April issue of Bride Monthly",
          "ok": true,
