    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He has the audacity to look sheepish. “I didn’t mean to scare you.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2074
        },
        {
          "text": "“I had a collection across the street.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3414
        },
        {
          "text": "The only building across the street is an assisted living facility. My irritation with him slips. “I’m sorry,” I murmur.",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3452
        }
      ],
      "words": 47
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They tell me that my reports imply I care for you more than a Reaper should care for any human. They say I’m skirting th",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8198
        },
        {
          "text": "Given that their read on me is correct, I thought it best for both of our sakes if I kept my distance for a short time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8460
        }
      ],
      "words": 57
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Because I would have missed today if I hadn’t convinced Daniel to intervene on my behalf with his bosses",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11743
        },
        {
          "text": "I want to grow old with my sister and have more adventures together",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12157
        },
        {
          "text": "But I can’t. This happy bubble I’m in with my sister will pop way too soon",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12226
        }
      ],
      "words": 50
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Tears spill down my cheeks before I can stop them. I turn away and dab at my eyes with a napkin in a last-ditch effort t",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12455
        },
        {
          "text": "Another lie to add to the others. Telling the truth about why I’m crying, though, would just crush her",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12727
