      "words": 50
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“As a Reaper, I have met the worst kinds of people",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17671
        },
        {
          "text": "Monsters, Lucy.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17790
        },
        {
          "text": "I was a monster once, too. So when I tell you that you are good, trust me. You are.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17820
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s been very easy to forget that he was originally supposed to go to Hell",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18261
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’m not sure I could stay away if I tried.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20440
        }
